    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d546">

                <pb facs="0609" n="597" sameAs="frus:frus1941v02/pg597"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.91262/189: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        France</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Leahy</hi>)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d546-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1941-03-17T18:00:00-05:00">March 17, 1941—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>803. For Paris. According to a D. N. B.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d546-f2"/> report
                    Jay Allen, American correspondent of the North American Newspaper Alliance, was
                        <pb facs="0610" n="598" xml:id="pg598"/> arrested together with another
                    unnamed American citizen while endeavoring to cross the demarcation line between
                    occupied and unoccupied France without correct papers.</p>
                <p>Please investigate and submit prompt report.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d546-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d546-f1-content">
                <p>The same, <hi rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, on the same date to The
                    Chargé in Germany as telegram No. 779.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d546-f2" n="2" xml:id="d546-f2-content">
                <p>Deutsches Nachrichten Büro.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
